d:
The Captain of the Port is enforcing a Regulated Navigation Area for the closure of the Morro Bay Harbor Entrance due to hazardous breaking seas, rough sea conditions, or shoaling. The closure includes all navigable waters from the surface to the seafloor of the Morro Bay Harbor Entrance Channel, bounded by the following coordinates: 

35.35583, -120.87000; 
35.36139, -120.87694; 
35.36528, -120.86944; 
35.36056, -120.86417; 

and returning to the point of origin (NAD 83). No vessels may enter, transit through, or remain within the regulated area unless authorized by the U.S. Coast Guard or assisting agencies. Vessels seeking permission to transit through the regulated area should contact the Coast Guard on VHF-FM Channel 16.
